- The Guerrilla Girls, a feminist activist group who used posters and billboards to highlight sexism in the art world; 
- Banksy, a street artist who has used his art to comment on social and political issues; 
- The Occupy movement which utilized tents and protests to advocate for economic justice; and 
- The Yes Men, a group of activists who used satirical events and media stunts to highlight corporate and government malfeasance. 
